---
title: Browser - attach or launch, and what dispose may do
line9:
  theme: boardroom
---
flowchart TD
  UNBOUND["Unbound<br>no endpoint, no process"]:::host
  LAUNCHED["Launched<br>we own the process"]:::host
  ATTACHED["Attached<br>somebody else owns it"]:::host
  LIVE["Live<br>the debug socket answers"]:::host
  EVALUATED["Evaluated<br>evaluate(expression) returned"]:::host
  UNAVAILABLE["Unavailable<br>no executable, or no endpoint"]:::fail
  DISPOSED["Disposed"]:::host
  UNBOUND ==>|"open(url), no endpoint"| LAUNCHED
  UNBOUND ==>|"open(url) with attachTo"| ATTACHED
  LAUNCHED ==>|"debug socket found"| LIVE
  ATTACHED ==>|"/json/version answers"| LIVE
  UNBOUND -.->|"no executable"| UNAVAILABLE
  LIVE -.->|"evaluate (expression)"| EVALUATED
  EVALUATED -->|"the answer returns"| LIVE
  LIVE -->|"dispose()"| DISPOSED
  ATTACHED -->|"dispose() only disconnects"| DISPOSED
  LAUNCHED -->|"dispose() closes the process"| DISPOSED
